<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>TANKERS - Ranger - (built 1976) 35,663 dwt sold to American buyers for $2.75 million.</p>
<p>Waswasan Setia - (built 1991) 29,755 dwt sold to Indian buyers for $17.2 million.</p>
<p>SOLD FOR DEMOLITION - Med Nagoya - (built 1973) sold to Indian breakers for $178.5 per ldt.</p>
<p>Some of these sales may not be final as they may be subject to inspection, survey or other conditions.</p>
</text>
